flowchart LR
  M[Plaintext move 1 / 2 / 3] --> C[Browser commitment]
  RNG[32-byte CSPRNG r] --> C
  C -->|C + context-bound signature only| NET[HTTPS network]
  NET --> DB[(Commitment stored)]
  DB --> Barrier{Both players committed?}
  Barrier -->|Yes| Reveal[Browser sends move + r]
  Reveal --> Check[Server verifies C = m·g + r·h]
  Check --> Log[(Public hash-linked event)]
  Log --> Browser[Browser independently verifies transcript]
  M -. stays local until reveal .-> Reveal
  RNG -. stays local until reveal .-> Reveal
